<%- include('./partials/header.ejs') %>

<!--Safety Tips-->
<div class="container px-4 py-3" id = "Safety">
    <div class="row p-4 pb-3 pe-lg-0 pt-lg-5 align-items-center rounded-3 border shadow-lg" id = "content">
        <div class="col-lg-6 p-3 p-lg-4 pt-lg-3">
            <h4 class="display-6 fw-bold lh-1 ">Safety Tips</h4>
            <div class="lead">
                <ul style="padding-top: 10px;">
                    <li>🧴Apply sunscreen 15–20 minutes before going out.</li>
                    <li>⌛Reapply every 2 hours.</li>
                    <li>🕶️Wear UV-protective sunglasses.</li>
                    <li>🥤Stay hydrated.</li>
                    <li>🕓Seek shade between 10 AM and 4 PM.</li>
                    <li>🥼Wear full sleeves if UV is very high.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-lg-6 p-3 p-lg-4 pt-lg-3">
            <h4 class="display-6 fw-bold lh-1 ">Did you know?</h4>
            <div class="lead">
                <ul style="padding-top: 10px;">
                    <li>⚠️ UV radiation can cause skin damage, eye damage, and increase the risk of skin cancer.</li>
                    <li>☀️ UV radiation is strongest between 10 AM and 4 PM.</li>
                    <li>🌤 Clouds don't block all UV rays.</li>
                    <li>💧 Water reflects UV rays.</li>
                    <li>❄ Snow can reflect up to 80% of UV radiation.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

